{"seq":5,"slug":"retirement-planning","title":"退休规划","stage":"DONE","category":"personal-finance-investing","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning","rating":{"composite":3.83,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.43,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introMarkdown":"# 退休规划\n\n退休规划是个人财务管理中最重要的长期目标之一。它不仅涉及养老金体系的理解与优化，更需要掌握退休数学、积累期策略和消耗期策略的系统性知识。在中国人均预期寿命已达 79.25 岁（2025 年数据）、渐进式延迟退休正式实施、个人养老金制度全面推开的大背景下，科学的退休规划已从\"可选\"变为\"必需\"。\n\n本 Hub 围绕退休规划的四个核心维度展开，帮助读者从零开始建立完整的退休规划知识体系。\n\n## 内容结构\n\n```mermaid\nmindmap\n  root((退休规划))\n    养老金体系\n      三支柱架构\n      个人养老金制度\n      社保养老金优化\n    退休数学\n      退休目标数字\n      蒙特卡洛模拟\n      长寿风险\n    积累期策略\n      储蓄率与财富积累\n      雇主福利最大化\n      副业与创业路径\n    消耗期策略\n      提取规则\n      桶策略\n      医疗与长期照护\n```\n\n## 核心主题\n\n| 章节       | 核心问题                   | 关键概念                      |\n| ---------- | -------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 养老金体系 | 国家给我多少？我还差多少？ | 三支柱、替代率、个人养老金    |\n| 退休数学   | 我需要存多少钱？           | 25 倍规则、蒙特卡洛、长寿风险 |\n| 积累期策略 | 怎么高效攒够退休金？       | 储蓄率、雇主匹配、多元收入    |\n| 消耗期策略 | 怎么花钱才不会花光？       | 4% 规则、桶策略、医疗规划     |\n\n## 适用读者\n\n- 25-35 岁：建立退休规划意识，利用时间复利优势\n- 35-50 岁：优化积累策略，最大化制度红利\n- 50-60 岁：精确计算退休缺口，制定消耗期方案\n- 已退休人群：优化提取策略，管理长寿风险\n\n## 中国特色要素\n\n本 Hub 特别关注中国退休规划的独特维度：\n\n- **渐进式延迟退休**（2025 年起实施，男性延至 63 岁、女性延至 55/58 岁）\n- **个人养老金制度**（2024 年 12 月全面推开，年缴存上限 12000 元）\n- **养老金替代率下行**（企业职工从 75% 降至约 43.8%）\n- **城乡与体制内外差距**（企业退休月均 3588 元 vs 机关事业单位 6215 元）\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pension-system","title":"养老金体系","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning/pension-system","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"three-pillars","title":"三支柱养老体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning/pension-system/three-pillars"},{"seq":2,"slug":"personal-pension-account","title":"个人养老金制度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning/pension-system/personal-pension-account"},{"seq":3,"slug":"social-security-optimization","title":"社保养老金最优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning/pension-system/social-security-optimization"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"retirement-math","title":"退休数学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning/retirement-math","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"retirement-number","title":"退休目标数字","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning/retirement-math/retirement-number"},{"seq":2,"slug":"monte-carlo-simulation","title":"蒙特卡洛模拟","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning/retirement-math/monte-carlo-simulation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"longevity-risk","title":"长寿风险","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning/retirement-math/longevity-risk"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"accumulation-phase","title":"积累期策略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning/accumulation-phase","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"savings-rate","title":"储蓄率与财富积累","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning/accumulation-phase/savings-rate"},{"seq":2,"slug":"employer-benefits","title":"雇主福利最大化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning/accumulation-phase/employer-benefits"},{"seq":3,"slug":"side-income-entrepreneurship","title":"副业与创业退休路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning/accumulation-phase/side-income-entrepreneurship"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"decumulation-phase","title":"消耗期策略","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning/decumulation-phase","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"withdrawal-rules","title":"提取规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning/decumulation-phase/withdrawal-rules"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bucket-strategy","title":"桶策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning/decumulation-phase/bucket-strategy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"healthcare-costs","title":"医疗与长期照护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-finance-investing/retirement-planning/decumulation-phase/healthcare-costs"}]}]}